# Committed: names the Convex dev deployment that `pnpm dev`, `pnpm dev:public`, `pnpm convex-dev`
# and `pnpm convex-dev-set-env` use, and never a secret (those live in Infisical). `pnpm build`
# reads none of it. `pnpm convex-dev` still writes its own copy to `.env.local`, which this
# overrides. The name is the one `pnpm exec convex deployment select dev` picks.
CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=dev:efficient-jackal-342
PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=https://efficient-jackal-342.convex.cloud
